[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://0rwc546jbj6x"]

; One variable: a directional lightmap. The same scene as `unit-lightmap-gi-baked.tscn`, baked with
; `directional = true`, so the atlas holds four layers of spherical harmonics per mesh and the
; read weighs them by the surface normal. The baked scene reads one layer, so it cannot show a
; wrong layer order or normal basis.

